From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:29:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScript: web APIs in JavaScript (webapi.js) with native
 helpers

webapi.js runs in every page after polyfill.js and fills in what the
bindings leave as stubs or lack: selectors (querySelector(All), matches,
closest, getElementsByClassName), ParentNode/ChildNode methods, children,
dataset, innerHTML serialization, outerHTML, inline style over the style
attribute, getComputedStyle, geometry, event constructors, createEvent
by interface, a constructible EventTarget, AbortController, Image,
Option, Text, createElementNS for HTML, requestAnimationFrame,
localStorage/sessionStorage, history state, matchMedia, URL,
URLSearchParams, TextEncoder/TextDecoder, atob/btoa, structuredClone,
DOMException.  Window.bnd gives it window.__netsurf_native: box
geometry, the viewport, computed style values, and the localStorage file
(~/.netsurf/storage/<origin>).
---
